5. Problem 5: Apply “Finding Explicit Evidence” to this prompt about the mentor passage (or a 3–5 sentence extension you invent that stays consistent). Include evidence. Item code 11-11.
6. Problem 6: Apply “Finding Explicit Evidence” to this prompt about the mentor passage (or a 3–5 sentence extension you invent that stays consistent). Include evidence. Item code 9-11.

