2. Correct application of Verbs Unit Review; before/after shows intentional change; explanation names the grammar job.
3. Correct application of Verbs Unit Review; before/after shows intentional change; explanation names the grammar job.
4. Correct application of Verbs Unit Review; before/after shows intentional change; explanation names the grammar job.
5. Correct application of Verbs Unit Review; before/after shows intentional change; explanation names the grammar job.
6. Correct application of Verbs Unit Review; before/after shows intentional change; explanation names the grammar job.

</details>

## Exit ticket

1. In one sentence, what does “Verbs Unit Review” help a reader or writer do?
2. Name the common mistake to avoid today (hint: related to using it''s when you mean the…).
3. Create one new practice item (with answer) a classmate could try in 2 minutes.

*(Scored exit items also appear as multiple-choice checks below the lesson in Prosper Prep.)*

