## Exit ticket

1. In one sentence, what does “Integration Capstone Response” help a reader or writer do?
2. Name the common mistake to avoid today (hint: related to using a vague pronoun (this/that/it) with…).
3. Create one new practice item (with answer) a classmate could try in 2 minutes.

*(Scored exit items also appear as multiple-choice checks below the lesson in Prosper Prep.)*

## Stretch (optional)

